<title>USA: Finish Line Inc Q4 March 1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Finish Line Inc Q4 March 1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share and store data)</p>
<p>				  Three months ended    Year ended</p>
<p>				    Mar 1, Feb 29,    Mar 1,  Feb 29,</p>
<p>					1997    1996	1997     1996</p>
<p> Net Sales		     $96,249 $70,623  $332,002 $240,155</p>
<p>Cost of Sales (including</p>
<p>  occupancy expenses)	 66,303  49,906   229,187  168,912</p>
<p> Gross profit		   29,946  20,717   102,815   71,243</p>
