<p>Fully diluted weighted</p>
<p>average number of</p>
<p>  shares outstanding	  26,161  20,631    23,761   20,712</p>
<p>Fully diluted net income</p>
<p>  per share			 0.26    0.17	0.79     0.47</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
